flowchart TD
    A[Perception: Collect data] --> B[Reasoning: Analyze and interpret]
    B --> C[Goal Setting: Define objectives / plan]
    C --> D[Decision Making: Choose next action]
    D --> E[Execution: Act via tools or APIs]
    E --> F[Observation: Read results & update memory]
    F --> G[Learning & Adaptation: Improve from feedback]
    G --> D
    subgraph Orchestration
      H[Coordinate multiple agents / workflows]
    end
    G --> H
    H --> A
    classDef agentic fill:#cfe2f3,stroke:#084c61,stroke-width:2px;
    class A,B,C,D,E,F,G,H agentic
